      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Doninha Marinha. Buizel gira as duas caudas como uma hélice para nadar e cortar algas. A bolsa de flutuação em seu pescoço mantém seu rosto acima da água enquanto observa as presas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Buizel pode evoluir para Floatzel no nível 9 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Sonic Boom, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Growl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Soak, Water Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bite, Pursuit</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Swift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Aqua Jet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Double Hit</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Whirlpool</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Liquidation, Razor Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Agility</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Hydro Pump, Wave Crash</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Aqua Tail, Attract, Baton Pass, Blizzard, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Chilling Water, Confide, Crunch, Dig, Double Team, Echoed Voice, Endure, Facade, Fling, Flip Turn, Focus Punch, Frustration, Hail, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Ice Fang, Ice Punch, Ice Spinner, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Liquidation, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Mud-Slap, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Scald, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Ring, Aqua Tail, Baton Pass, Double Slap, Fury Cutter, Fury Swipes, Headbutt, Helping Hand, Me First, Mud-Slap, Odor Sleuth, Slash, Soak, Switcheroo, Tail Slap</p>",
